@group A
@commands `cdevtest help`; `cdevtest bogus`; `cdevtest state 0 -60 4000`; `cdevtest count 1 2 3`
@pass `verb=help verbs=` lists state ... tickwarp ... states; `verb=bogus error="unknown verb ...` `done=0`; `error="unloaded 0,-60,4000 ...` `done=0`; `error="missing to x"` `done=0`; no stack trace, server up
